{"id":"wb-7-1140","name":"兴隆塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"兴隆塔","text":"兴隆塔，位于山东省济宁市兖州市城内东北隅，是中华人民共和国全国重点文物保护单位之一。\n1977年12月23日，公布为山东省文物保护单位，2013年5月公布为全国重点文物保护单位，是一座古建筑及历史纪念建筑物。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%B4%E9%9A%86%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86783431,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86783431","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b0448e7c927c0074eee51054.jpg","title":"Xinglong_Pagoda_in_Yanzhou_2012-07.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xinglong_Pagoda_in_Yanzhou_2012-07.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/Xinglong_Pagoda_in_Yanzhou_2012-07.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​兖州兴隆寺兴隆塔。","width":320,"height":427}}